      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹2.29 (vs ₹1.89 in FY 2025)",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹2.29 (up from ₹1.89 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹125.3m (up 37% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹46.7m (up 21% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 37% (down from 42% in FY 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by higher expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 28% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 45% per year, which means it is tracking significantly ahead of earnings growth.",
